/E (The past weeks brought a massive wave of technical, structural, and economy updates across the entire BrainlyHQ ecosystem. A primary focus was placed on the official launch of the long-awaited Partner Program. This milestone involved pushing 10 development commits to GitHub, launching the dedicated Partnership Program website with a Furious Studios promo pop-up, creating bespoke lookup codes, and setting up dedicated partner channels, roles, and verification commands. In tandem with these networking efforts, the core community framework saw the creation of new server logos and seasonal variants, a complete review of moderation and server rules \(including the addition of Point 22\), an updated welcome message graphic, and the addition of vibrant new emojis and stickers. Structural navigation was heavily optimized by adding an official changelog channel, reopening the recruitment section, and updating numerous channel descriptions - including the server-map layout - while successfully fixing a bug related to invisible channels. Entertainment and social engagement also received a major boost with the launch of a new Truth & Dare section, the restoration of the "Last Letter" channel, and the scheduling of upcoming technical breaks accompanied by finalized outstanding notes.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
